# Environment variables
.env

# Position and the watch set (backlog task 013, 2026-08-31).
# These name real decisions, deadlines, exposures and beliefs. They belong in
# the operator's PRIVATE repo -- under version control there, because the
# quarterly review's value is the diff -- and never in this public one. Point
# POSITION_PATH / WATCHES_PATH at them; the defaults live outside any checkout.
# The *.example.yaml files in config/ are committed and are not matched here.
/position.yaml
/watches.yaml
config/position.yaml
config/watches.yaml

# Backlog task 026, 2026-09-22 (docs/PLAN.md). A real estate/ directory at the
# repo root would hold the operator's private files; they belong in the private
# repo beside Position. The audit log holds every model payload that left the
# machine. Exports are the operator's data.
/estate/
data/llm-audit/
data/exports/
# OAuth artefacts by name, in case a sensor library ever writes one to disk.
client_secret*.json
token*.json
.secrets.baseline.tmp

